# oracle: a 2d sphere and ellipsoid region on a square lattice of 0.1 (PACKAGES/dpd-smooth/2d-diffusion: radius 0.5 holds 81 points as in native, the 8 at (3,4)-type positions included); the 2d ellipsoid ignores z
units           metal
dimension       2
atom_style      atomic
lattice         sq 0.1 origin 0 0 0
region          box block -6 6 -6 6 -0.5 0.5
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
region          s sphere 0 0 0 0.5 units box
region          e ellipsoid 0 0 0 0.5 0.5 0.1 units box
region          e2 ellipsoid 0 0 0 0.3 0.4 0.1 units box
group           s region s
group           e region e
group           e2 region e2
variable        ns equal count(s)
variable        ne equal count(e)
variable        ne2 equal count(e2)
neighbor        0.01 bin
pair_style      zero 0.05
pair_coeff      * *
thermo_style    custom step v_ns v_ne v_ne2
run             0
